This is Debian GNU's prepackaged version of udhcp, a
program which provides a DHCP client and server.

This package was put together by me,
Matt Kraai <kraai@debian.org>, from the sources, which I obtained
from http://opensource.lineo.com/udhcp/source/udhcp-0.9.4.tar.gz
The changes were minimal, namely:

- adding support for the Debian package maintenance scheme, by
  adding various debian/* files.

